1}":[39,40],"#Exploring Abnormal Behavior Patterns of Online Users With Emotional Eating Behavior: Topic Modeling Study#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/6BC5WR2P","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/5LKI4AEG?page=1&annotation=6LUB4AH2","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/5LKI4AEG?page=1&annotation=URLGJSAA","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/5LKI4AEG?page=1&annotation=AE5QSLFS","line":39}],"metadata":{"Title":"Exploring Abnormal Behavior Patterns of Online Users With Emotional Eating Behavior: Topic Modeling Study","Authors":"Youjin Hwang, Hyung Jun Kim, Hyung Jin Choi, Joonhwan Lee","Year":2020,"DOI":"10.2196/15700","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"This study aimed to analyze the behavior patterns of emotional eaters as the first step to designing a personalized intervention system.The machine learning (ML) framework and Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) topic modeling tool were used to collect and analyze behavioral data on EE.","Findings":"","Conclusions":"This study introduces a data-driven approach for analyzing behavior patterns of social website users with EE behaviors. We discovered the possibility of the LDA topic model as an exploratory user study method for abnormal behaviors in medical research. We also investigated the possibilities of ML- and topic modeling–based classifiers to automatically categorize text-based behavioral data, which could be applied to personalized medicine in future research.","Limitations":"","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1e51wkp","at":1774939661441}},"smart_blocks:hwangExploringAbnormalBehavior2020a.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.02952293,0